    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100103/6001001030030"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001030040,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "だけどそのとき、みんなの応援が耳に届いたんです\r\n頑張れ～、頑張れ～、って！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100103/6001001030040"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001030050,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "それを聞いたら、急に体がふわ～ってなって……\r\nいつもよりもしっかり歌えたんです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100103/6001001030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001030060,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "だから、勝てたのは私一人の力じゃありません\r\n応援してくれたみんなのおかげですっ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100103/6001001030060"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "良いファンを持ったんだな、真乃",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その人たちのためにも、\r\n決勝は思いきりやってやろうな",
